      "readme": "This dataset contains 3T fMRI data from 16 subjects who completed a visual task involving a radial checkerboard that flickered at a rate of 4, 8, 12 or 40 Hz. Physiological data is available from each run, and contains pulse oximetry, respiration, and trigger channels.\n\n\nThe correct TR for all functional runs is 0.378 seconds.\n",
